   Jemberie, BA (Corresponding Author), Debre Markos Univ, Fac Technol, Dept Civil Engn, POB 269, Debre Markos, Ethiopia.
   Ouazar, Kahina; Mansour, Leila Abbas, Univ Sci \& Technol Houari Boumediene, Dept Geog \& Terr Planning, LREAU Lab, Algiers 16000, Algeria.
